WEBVTT

00:42.852 --> 00:52.461
The engine hums, a steady beat 30,000 tired feet

00:53.242 --> 00:59.187
Above the clouds, a sea of white Escaping from

00:59.207 --> 01:06.570
the endless night Your hand in mine A steady

01:06.670 --> 01:14.372
grace, the only anchor in this place You let me

01:14.472 --> 01:21.894
lean against your side With nothing left to run

01:21.914 --> 01:22.995
or hide

01:27.137 --> 01:36.729
And for the first time in so long I can breathe

01:38.211 --> 01:40.573
A quiet promise

01:42.556 --> 01:44.538
I believe

01:48.457 --> 01:52.398
Your shoulder is my only home right now A silent,

01:52.458 --> 01:56.839
true, and sacred vow A sanctuary in the sky

01:56.859 --> 02:00.780
Beneath the calm and endless sky Is all I need to

02:00.860 --> 02:08.262
feel okay And chase the lingering fog Away

02:10.603 --> 02:17.891
I think about the static sound on that unholy

02:18.171 --> 02:25.420
hollow ground. Think about the pouring rain,

02:25.900 --> 02:31.767
the endless fear, the burning pain. But then I

02:31.827 --> 02:38.552
feel you squeeze my hand And I begin to

02:39.092 --> 02:46.177
understand The storm has passed, the war is done

02:46.618 --> 02:50.461
A quiet battle has been won

02:54.867 --> 03:02.436
And for the first time in so long I can breathe

03:05.920 --> 03:08.363
A quiet promise

03:10.225 --> 03:12.768
I believe

03:16.080 --> 03:20.143
Your shoulder is my only home right now A silent,

03:20.203 --> 03:24.567
true, and sacred vow This sanctuary in the sky

03:24.607 --> 03:28.530
Beneath the calm and endless eye Is all I need to

03:28.610 --> 03:34.655
feel okay And chase the lingering fog away

04:23.170 --> 04:23.432
you

05:12.878 --> 05:17.221
Safe. Thank you.

